ess_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"aG1m3tufKdPsRiberh6T9g","review_id":"ITyDDV7taWAezOmWawrfhw","date":"2019-02-06T01:52:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9096547961235046,"text_excerpt":"Daisy Dukes is a super casual, divey, diner-y, hole in the wall. I ordered a burger after a few days straight of Cajun food and Poboys and it hit the spot. The burger was larger than I was expecting and the beef was good quality. The fries that came with my meal were plentiful. It looks like Daisy Dukes Cafe have a better than average breakfast menu. I probably should have come in for some pancakes during my recent New Orleans stay ... and skipped PJs and Starbucks one morning. The service was better than average and very friendly on my visit. I would be happy to eat here again."},{"business_id":"aG1m3tufKdPsRiberh6T9g","review_id":"P-629_Xd1IpjyvxexfgNyA","date":"2020-02-26T13:28:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9062988758087158,"text_excerpt":"After a full morning of drinking and catching beads from parades on Fat Tuesday, we decided to take a break and head to Jimmy J. The line during lunchtime was unbelievably long so we went next door to Daisy Duke and I was very satisfied with our choice. The wait in line to be seated wasn't long for my group of 4 (about 10 minutes tops) as the restaurant was much bigger than Jimmy J's, which had a line that had people already waiting past an hour to get in. I was not feeling my best from drinking more than I usually did with a queasy stomach and sleepiness and decided to share with my friend a crawfish etouffee, rice and beans, and gumbo appetizers along with two biscuits. I don't know wha..."},{"business_id":"aG1m3tufKdPsRiberh6T9g","review_id":"s8uC_1eKYwaiFGPViw8k5A","date":"2016-10-21T20:41:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9008474946022034,"text_excerpt":"Saw this when we were looking for a breakfast place. Very small place but they were very busy. The manager got us in as quickly as possible. The waitress was great. Definitely would recommend this place to eat."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"aG1m3tufKdPsRiberh6T9g","photo_id":"n-mE_Lf-GoPVHVY1TXG9Rg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/n-mE_Lf-GoPVHVY1TXG9Rg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9999998807907104}]},"notebook_case":null}
